# docs/guide/testing{,.ja}.md の `$ sober …` の塊（1 行 = 名前 + 空白 + コマンド。上から順に同じ作業場所で走らせる — s4-replay は s4-fuzz が書いたコーパスを読む）
s1-ok sober test examples/guide/kv2 --run TestParse
s1-fail sober test examples/guide/kvbug --run TestParse
s2-fail sober test examples/guide/kvbug --run TestRoundTrip
s2-ok sober test examples/guide/kv2
s3-cover sober test examples/guide/kv2 --cover
s3-mutate sober test examples/guide/kv2 --mutate
s3-after sober test examples/guide/kv3 --mutate
s4-fuzz sober fuzz examples/guide/kvbug --run TestAnyLine --time 5s
s4-replay sober test examples/guide/kvbug --run TestAnyLine
s4-after sober test examples/guide/kv --mutate
s5-sched sober fuzz examples/guide/kv --run TestCountAll --sched --time 2s
